Package: linux-epub-reader
Version: 0.13.15-1
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk, python3-pil, python3-mutagen, python3-dbus-next, mpv
Maintainer: Linux EPUB Reader contributors
Description: Local-first dark-mode EPUB reader
 A text-oriented EPUB reader for Linux with continuous chapter scrolling,
 a left-hand table of contents, bookmarks, chapter progress, local M4B audiobooks,
 and a separate offline, DRM-free music library with albums and playlists.
 .
 Adobe DRM is detected but not natively implemented in this application.
 .
 Protected books show an explanatory notice; no external reader is launched.
